Package: fk-archive-utils
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 openssh-sftp-server,
 sudo,
Description: privileged mutations of a Frikanalen media archive
 The ingest engine writes into the media archive over SSH. Rather than giving
 the account it logs in as write access to the archive, this package installs
 the four mutations the archive actually needs -- publish a file, move a file
 within a video, trash a directory, purge the trash -- as commands that run as
 the account owning the archive, reached through a single sudoers rule.
 .
 Every command validates the paths it is given against the archive's namespace,
 traverses it without following symbolic links, and refuses to overwrite or
 delete anything: removal is a rename into .trash/, and only
 fk-archive-purge-trash, which the ingest account is not granted, empties it.
